<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f5; padding:32px 16px;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:32px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <p style="font-weight:800; font-size:20px; color:#111827; margin:0 0 24px;">{{ shopName }}</p>

    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#111827; margin:0 0 16px;">Bonjour {{ firstName }},</p>
    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 20px;">
      {{ shopName }} a une offre spéciale pour vous :
    </p>

    <div style="background:#fdf1f1; border-radius:10px; padding:16px 20px; margin:0 0 20px;">
      <p style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#c8272c; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.5px; margin:0 0 4px;">Votre offre</p>
      <p style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; color:#111827; margin:0;">{{ offer.title }}</p>
    </div>

    {% if offer.description %}
      <p style="font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 20px;">{{ offer.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 12px;">
      Présentez ce code en caisse pour en profiter, jusqu'au <strong>{{ offer.valid_until|date('d/m/Y') }}</strong> :
    </p>
    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 24px;">
      <span style="display:inline-block; border:2px dashed #c8272c; color:#111827; font-weight:800; font-size:22px; letter-spacing:3px; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px;">{{ code }}</span>
    </p>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 24px;">
      <a href="{{ offersUrl }}" style="display:inline-block; background:#c8272c; color:#ffffff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; text-decoration:none; padding:14px 28px; border-radius:8px;">
        Voir mes offres
      </a>
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:11px; color:#9ca3af; line-height:1.6; margin:24px 0 0; border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6; padding-top:16px;">
      Vous recevez cet e-mail car vous êtes client de {{ shopName }}.
      <a href="{{ unsubscribeUrl }}" style="color:#6b7280;">Ne plus recevoir nos e-mails</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
